WEBVTT

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:14.200
Perfect! The Armstrong Cannon's 
in perfect shape today!

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.900
Power belongs to those who should wield it.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.000
Now, do as God wills and give us the Onigami.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:30.420
Ver-bigdick-chan has finally 
come to steal it by force.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.600
<i>The black ship from a distant land</i>

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.050
<i>fired steel shells as it approached Nagasaki.</i>

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:43.700
<i>The battle for the Onigami begins, 
and the times face a drastic turn.</i>

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:55.650
<b>Dai Shogun</b>

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:55.650
Great Revolution

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:19.030
<b>Episode 11:
Led by the Onigami, to Share Our Fate!</b>

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:19.030
Trouble! Trouble!

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:21.880
There's a black ship in the harbor!

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:25.040
It's firing a huge cannon. 
The whole town is panicked!

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:28.500
Wha— That was a black ship?

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.250
We have to run, now!

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:33.470
A black ship?

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:37.170
Boss?

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:39.280
Keiichiro-sama, you mustn't!

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:42.070
The foreigners are attacking.

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.890
Kiriko, give me the seal.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.320
What are you talking about?  
You can barely even walk!

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:49.140
It's impossible, Boss!

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.100
No!

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:53.940
I saw it...

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:58.760
The town will become a sea of flames.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:01.450
So I have to go!

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.580
We're getting out of here!

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:05.830
Are you running?

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.700
We don't have time to deal with you.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.980
Wait!

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:16.360
Susanoo? Keiichiro woke up?

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:24.720
Please stop!

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:26.140
Stop it, Kei-chan!

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:28.430
<i>Kei-chan!</i>

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:28.430
<i>Keiichiro-sama!</i>

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.140
I'll protect Nagasaki!

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:41.530
Kiriko-dono!

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.240
Where's Keiichiro?

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.400
He said he's protecting the 
town from the foreigners.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.700
We'll follow him!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.500
Houkouin?

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:01.260
You're trying to interfere with the boy again?

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:05.680
Keep firing!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.730
He's here.

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:30.970
Takemikazuchi...

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:36.170
Hey! Show him the power 
of the Armstrong Cannon!

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.670
One more shot!

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.360
Wha—

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.980
Goddamn!

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.950
They never learn.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:13.700
The insufferable weapons humans 
make cannot harm me!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.880
The judgment of the Onigami 
will turn you to dust!

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:27.420
My cute and strong fleet!

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:31.390
Truly a darkness darker than black...

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:42.270
A demon who fell to Earth, 
and who will burn it all...

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:49.870
Verbeck!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:02.020
So you're here, Tokugawa Keiichiro.

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:05.380
Our blood destiny brings us together at last!

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:07.970
Hitotsubashi Shigeyoshi?

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:10.170
Susanoo...

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:15.270
Takemikazuchi guided me here, 
and I see you are still in your cocoon.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:21.150
Takemikazuchi, do you want me 
to devour such a weak demon?

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.270
Then...

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:47.290
Look upon this well, Keiichiro.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:50.430
This is the end brought about by your weakness.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:56.840
For those who have power, 
to not wield it is a sin!

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:02.730
You bastard...

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:06.230
None of them had anything to do with this!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.240
Who the hell do you think you are?!

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:17.160
Your eyes flash with the color of blood.

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:20.580
You have touched the abyss of the Demon's Wish?

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.790
What?

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.840
Then you saw them.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:28.290
Beyond the Demon's Wish, even now the 
demons fight, burned by the flames of hell.

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:31.550
They are violent, and ugly.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.370
And around them spreads a black darkness.

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:41.980
The path of carnage, 
paved over endless corpses.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.190
Raging storms, burning hellfire...

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.610
It is hell, where monsters roam.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:55.570
And at the lowest levels of 
hell, I faced the demons.

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:58.520
My body was torn asunder, burned by hellfire,

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:01.250
and I gained a greater power than the demons!

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:05.000
Don't look away, Tokugawa Keiichiro!

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:11.130
In the hell of the dead, the demons 
shall lead us and make us perfect!

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:16.450
Rage, grieve, sorrow, 
and rise with the demons!

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:18.650
Fall into the darkness 
until the end of your life,

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:20.640
and gain the great power of the demons!

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:32.360
Now... I will awaken the true power of 
Susanoo, which awaits in those depths!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.700
Heaven's Lightning Wave!

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:06.840
Now become a demon!

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:10.480
Shut up.

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:13.340
Who cares about the true power of demons?

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:17.750
Sorry, but I'm not taking any 
power from this thing at all.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:19.120
What?

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:23.250
I refuse to let a demon take over my heart!

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:36.300
Goodnight!

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.470
What is she?

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.390
We can't even touch her.

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:49.610
No less from the boy who made me wet.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:52.480
Three little girls, fighting bravely for him...

00:09:53.000 --> 00:10:01.450
But I can't let you interfere with the 
meeting between Shigeyoshi and the boy.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:06.410
Wh-What is this?

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:10.250
I've but one goal.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:20.120
Kiriko-dono?

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:21.390
Ice woman!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:32.770
You are a bug, crawling on the ground.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:39.490
Your thin arms are fragile, and you're 
protecting your frail purity with your life.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.620
What a waste of time.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.660
Look once more

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:51.080
upon the dark wishes of the demon that 
rest in the depths of those crimson eyes!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:07.720
You are still not worthy of being devoured.

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:35.380
Kiriko was taken by Shigeyoshi's woman?

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:36.540
Yes.

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:39.840
When the smoke cleared, she was gone.

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:43.300
Kei-chan!

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:49.350
Are you okay, Kei-chan?

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.480
Don't worry, his wounds are light.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:54.190
But it looks like the demon has him again.

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:55.760
What?

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:56.770
Who are you?

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:59.030
Just a passing wanderer.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:01.550
Don't need to thank me.

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:03.360
Hey!

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:09.410
Where do I put this?

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.310
Kei-chan...

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:24.130
How dare they do this to him?!

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.600
I'll never forgive them!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.930
Calm down, Chiharu.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:31.960
We cannot defeat it.

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:34.730
It burned the entire town in an instant.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:39.070
What? You just want to sit here and wait?

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.990
No.

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:44.570
No... but something's not right.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:46.270
What?

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:50.190
Why didn't Shigeyoshi kill Keiichiro?

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:53.040
Why did he kidnap Kiriko?

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:58.250
You think Kiriko has something to do with 
the reason Susanoo went out of control?

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:48.890
An empty castle sure is quiet.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:53.730
Disobeying Shigeyoshi-sama and giving 
information to the foreigners is a grave crime.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:55.390
They deserved it.

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.300
Soji, how are you feeling?

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:03.610
I'm all right.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:07.510
I can't die in my bed yet.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:11.030
Don't push yourself. We'll handle the rest.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:16.040
You said yourself that we can't survive 
without Shigeyoshi-sama, Hii-chan!

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:18.040
But that doesn't mean...

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.290
I'll offer my life for Shigeyoshi-sama.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.340
That's what it means to be in the Shinsengumi.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.960
Risking your life, huh?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.900
Yeah, you're right. Well said, Soji.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:31.600
I'm moved by your spirit.

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:36.310
And I don't want you two 
hogging all the glory.

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:41.850
You, either. Don't go beating 
us to the fun again. Got it?

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:44.460
Yeah, Kon-chan, Hii-chan.

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:50.110
And Shigeyoshi-sama and that 
Onigami will show us the way.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:53.250
It's just like 21 years ago.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:01.040
You're using that girl to 
draw out Susanoo's power?

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.570
The rage of the Onigami...

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:12.570
When its pilot is filled with rage, 
hate, and negative feelings,

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:16.430
its true, hidden power will awaken.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:27.940
So we must enrage the boy once more.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:32.910
If that girl dies right in front of him...

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:40.190
The Demon's Wish has tainted you so deeply.

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:41.750
Your thoughts are terrifying.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:46.000
The clouds will someday cover the moon.

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:50.510
It is inevitable that the 
dark overcome the light.

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:13.550
K...iriko...

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.200
What is it, Kei-chan?

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:19.720
Ki...ri...ko...

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:27.770
Hyogo...

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:33.630
I've received word that a massive ship 
is docked at Shimabara Castle.

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:36.490
It's probably the guys 
who kidnapped Kiriko-san.

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:37.600
And you're going there?

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:41.520
I'm going to save Kiriko-dono.

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:42.810
It'll be a great fight!

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.310
Why?

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:49.490
Why would you do all this for that woman?

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:53.250
Your goal is to avenge your father, isn't it?

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:55.570
Because it's what Keiichiro wants.

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.570
What he wants?

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:03.260
He's so straightforward he's almost stupid, 
and he never worries about the details.

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:07.580
I fell in love with the way he is.

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:12.790
And now his thoughts are 
turned to Kiriko-dono.

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:16.800
So I want to help him.

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:20.440
Take care of Otomi-dono.

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.390
I'm going, too.

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:26.310
Kei-chan saved me, too.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:30.930
When I got desperate and 
started to get into bad stuff,

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:34.320
he yelled at me and made me stop.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:38.420
He was the first man to take me seriously.

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:41.960
We got mad at each other, 
laughed at each other, cried...

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:48.720
He gave me a place to call home, 
where I could enjoy being with other people.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:49.920
Chiharu-san...

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:53.260
I'll do anything for Kei-chan!

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:56.130
Now it's my turn to save him!

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:59.080
We're both stupid women.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.680
Keiichiro only cares for Kiriko-dono.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:05.430
I haven't given up on him yet!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:09.190
Okay, let's get going, then!

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:12.120
You stay here, Hyakusuke.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:13.440
What? Why?

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:16.210
If the enemy attacks again,

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:19.700
we can't leave old grannie Otomi 
to protect Kei-chan again, right?

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:25.700
Got it! Leave it to me!

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:38.720
Behaving yourself?

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:41.930
Kill me!

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:46.160
I've no intention of being 
a burden to Keiichiro-sama.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:50.520
Kill me, and I'm sure he'll defeat you all.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:56.440
You're willing to sacrifice your 
life to save the man you love.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.940
Beautiful.

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:00.400
Stop it!

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:05.120
That girl didn't like it at first, either.

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:06.740
That girl?

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:14.290
In the distant past, there was a shrine 
priestess who prayed and spoke to the gods.

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:18.940
She would call the rain, play with 
the wind, and laugh with the light.

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:24.300
She was connected with all 
things, and loved by the gods.

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:27.720
And like you, she fell.

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:34.190
She was a virgin, without doubt.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:38.400
She eventually became connected with 
a demon, and drove his heart mad.

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:41.400
Just like you.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:43.410
Why are you telling me this?

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.870
Why, indeed?

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:49.750
If nothing else, you don't know 
nearly enough about yourself.

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:06.180
Keiichiro!

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:11.710
What an idiot.

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:14.170
The difference between his power 
and Shigeyoshi's is clear.

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:16.980
He's running off to a fight he can't win!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:20.240
A man's fight isn't about winning or losing.

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:23.030
If there's someone you can't 
forgive, you go after him.

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.330
If there's an open hole, you shove it in.

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:28.200
That's what it means to be 
a man who creates a new era.

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:30.700
You're past saving.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:39.480
Now, let's go see the future of this country!

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:49.810
Demon, Takemikazuchi, 
do you hear Susanoo's voice?

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.700
I can feel it.

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:58.840
His rage, his sorrow, his moans of humiliation...

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:01.530
I can hear them even now.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.770
When Susanoo awakens to its rage,

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:13.200
I will devour it with Takemikazuchi and 
gain power surpassing God himself!

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:26.340
The men possessed by the Onigami are 
fighting for the shrine priestess.

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:28.540
Excellent.

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:34.020
This boring world will finally see a little chaos.

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:39.640
Keiichiro-sama...

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:47.030
Wait for me, Kiriko!

00:23:25.970 --> 00:23:28.000
The final battle is here!

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:29.880
The hour of fate is now!

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:32.310
It's eat or be eaten, 
a battle between demons!

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.300
Will it be light or darkness 
that saves the world?

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:35.810
Or will it be rage or love?

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:38.310
In the last episode, the final 
battle to decide Japan's fate!

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:40.620
<b>Next Time: 
Break the Thunderclouds, 
Heavenly Thunder God Susanoo!</b>

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:39.670
The best in Japan!
